  ("Prothom client kothay?","Tin channel: (1) porichito shobai-ke bolun, (2) niche community-te dhuke age free-te sahajjo korun, (3) platform profile (Upwork/Fiverr/local). Warm outreach cold-er 10 gun convert kore."),
